+
+## echo
+
+Repeats the signal after `delay_ms` (converted to samples, at least 1),
+feeding the repeats back into the delay line. Per channel, with D the delay
+in samples and w zero before the stream starts:
+
+    w[n] = x[n] + feedback * w[n - D]
+    y[n] = x[n] + mix * w[n - D]
+
+| Parameter | Type | Default | Range |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `delay_ms` | float | 250 | 1 to 2000 |
+| `feedback` | float | 0.4 | 0 to 0.95 |
+| `mix` | float | 0.5 | 0 to 1 |
